.env
# The operator's own prompt documents, which supersede the harness defaults the same way `.env`
# supersedes `.env.example`. The `.example` files are documentation and are never loaded.
# Root-anchored so a module or subdirectory prompt file of the same name stays visible.
/SYSTEM.md
/CONTEXT.md
.local/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
container/node_modules/
*.zip

.DS_Store

.agent-state/
.kimi-code/
.playwright-cli/
.serena/
